      "message": "Hi William, AptX voice codec is not deprecated. There are good number of headsets/earbuds being launched with the codec. From phone side, we have been supporting it on most of Qualcomm chipsets for many years. \n\nHi Jakub,\nThis is what we think. We should check for LC3 first. If LC3 support is available on headset, prioritize it even if AptX voice is supported by headset. Fallback to CVSD from LC3 if eSCO connection fails for some reason with LC3 codec. \n\nIf LC3 is not supported by headset, go with AptX voice codec if headset supports it. Fallback to CVSD from Aptx voice codec, if eSCO connection fails for some reason with Aptx voice codec.",
